// Speech and private delivery across two mock sessions.
// The fixture programmer shares the fixture room with the fixture player.

// Room speech reaches the speaker and the observer.
@nonprogrammer
% say hello there
=You say, "hello there"

@programmer
; return 1;
1
=Test Player says, "hello there"

// Private whispers reach the speaker and the target only.
@nonprogrammer
% whisper psst to testprog
=You whisper, "psst" to Test Programmer.

@programmer
; return 1;
1
=Test Player whispers, "psst"
